deft archive - commands (input -> output)
  add      file... -> zip      Add files to a copy of a ZIP
  create   file... -> archive  Pack files and folders: --to zip|tar.gz|tar.xz|7z
  extract  archive -> dir      Unpack into a folder
  list     archive -> report   List entries without unpacking
More: deft archive <command> --help
